OL,5,G0115 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FIt's a busy day at King's, as 400
OL,7,     Fpatients are treated in 24 hours.
OL,8,     FPeggy, who's 85, comes in with her
OL,9,     Fdoting husband. And Ben's swollen
OL,10,     Ffinger is more serious than he
OL,11,     Frealises.
